  "id": "lobster-mac-and-cheese",
  "name": "Lobster Mac and Cheese",
  "subtitle": "Creamy baked pasta with tender lobster and a crisp cheese topping",
  "description": "A rich macaroni casserole combining lobster, sharp cheeses, thyme, and a seasoned panko crust.",
